			description: [
				"Coking coal gives off coal tar, and charring logs wood spirit, into a tank in the Furnace. Pipe either off from any side, or bucket it out. The tank holds a bucket of one; overflow, or the other one, burns off at the chimney."
				""
				"Remember that black goo? Almost every chemical in this book starts with coal tar."
			]
			id: "670861ACF270D86D"
