			description: [
				"Limestone or chalk fired at &cSearing&r burns to quicklime, giving off carbon dioxide. Wash it into slaked lime, then mix that with soda ash and water for caustic soda and chalk."
				""
				"Soda ash comes from kelp: fire it to ash and wash that. Later, splitting salt water makes caustic soda by the bucket."
			]
			id: "2F5032893F65C980"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "From lime and kelp"
