				"20B01B5CDC744C67"
				"3AC9A7994C4F9DC0"
			]
			description: [
				"Stand tanks on a full layer of Create's andesite scaffolding and they form a vat, up to three wide and five high. It's closed, so it keeps the gases a basin would lose, and it holds up to four fluids at once in layers."
				""
				"Left alone it settles and ferments. A mixer used on its side stirs it, but only one of the vat's own metal: copper for Create's copper tanks. Create's own mixer won't fit."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Vat Mixing tab. Ponder: the copper mixer.&r"
			]
